{"license":"DANS Licence","fileAccessRequest":false,"metadataBlocks":{"citation":{"displayName":"Citation Metadata","name":"citation","fields":[{"typeName":"title","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Getuigen Verhalen, Retourtje Sachsenhausen, interview 07"},{"typeName":"otherId","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"otherIdAgency":{"typeName":"otherIdAgency","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"DANS-KNAW"},"otherIdValue":{"typeName":"otherIdValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"easy-dataset:40933"}}]},{"typeName":"author","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"authorName":{"typeName":"authorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Stichting Nationaal Monument Kamp Vught"}}]},{"typeName":"datasetContact","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"datasetContactName":{"typeName":"datasetContactName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"M de Jong"},"datasetContactAffiliation":{"typeName":"datasetContactAffiliation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Nationaal Monument Kamp Vught"}}]},{"typeName":"dsDescription","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"dsDescriptionValue":{"typeName":"dsDescriptionValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Pim Reijntjes werd in de oorlog opgepakt vanwege Engelandvaren. Hij belandde in Scheveningen en werd naar kamp Vught gebracht. In het interview gaat het vooral om het dagelijks leven in kamp Vught en hoe zijn kampervaring van invloed is geweest op de rest van zijn leven.<\/p>"}}]},{"typeName":"subject","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Arts and Humanities","Social Sciences"]},{"typeName":"keyword","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Engelandvaart"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Onderduikers"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Kamp Vught"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Dagelijks leven kamp Vught"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Fusillades"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Oorlogstrauma"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"oral history"}},{"keywordValue":{"typeName":"keywordValue","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"Tweede Wereldoorlog"}}]},{"typeName":"language","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]},{"typeName":"productionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2008-09-26"},{"typeName":"contributor","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"contributorName":{"typeName":"contributorName","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"drs. Anne-Marie van Oosteren"}}]},{"typeName":"distributionDate","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2009-03-06"},{"typeName":"dateOfDeposit","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"2008-09-26"},{"typeName":"series","multiple":true,"typeClass":"compound","value":[{"seriesInformation":{"typeName":"seriesInformation","multiple":false,"typeClass":"primitive","value":"<p>Het project 'Retourtje Sachsenhausen' behandelt de deportaties van gevangenen vanuit Kamp Vught naar concentratiekamp Sachsenhausen. Hoewel er gedurende de hele oorlog gevangenen vanuit Vught naar Sachsenhausen werden afgevoerd, zijn de treinen die op 5 en 6 september 1944 vertrokken het meest berucht. Zo'n drieduizend mannen werden toen gedeporteerd, slechts de helft keerde terug.<br><br>Bij de Sachsenhausen-herdenking in september 2006 riep een oud-gevangene zijn mede-slachtoffers op om over hun ervaringen in de concentratiekampen Vught en Sachsenhausen te vertellen, omdat er niet lang meer overlevenden zullen zijn die hun verhalen kunnen doorgeven. Deze oproep was voor de gemeente Vught aanleiding het initiatief te nemen voor het project 'Retourtje Sachsenhausen'. Samen met het Vughts Historisch Museum en Nationaal Monument Kamp Vught is het project uitgewerkt. Het project bestaat uit drie onderdelen: het vastleggen van wat er gebeurd is d.m.v. 11 interviews met overlevenden, een documentaire waarin een overlevende de reis per trein nogmaals maakt, vergezeld van een scholier die hem daarover vragen stelt. Het derde deel bestaat uit een lespakket voor middelbare scholen.<\/p>"}}]}]},"dansRights":{"displayName":"Rights Metadata","name":"dansRights","fields":[{"typeName":"dansRightsHolder","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["Unknown"]},{"typeName":"dansPersonalDataPresent","multiple":false,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":"Unknown"},{"typeName":"dansMetadataLanguage","multiple":true,"typeClass":"controlledVocabulary","value":["Dutch"]}]},"dansRelationMetadata":{"displayName":"Relation Metadata","name":"dansRelationMetadata","fields":[{"typeName":"dansAudience","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34300","https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D60000"],"expandedvalue":[{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D34300","termName":[{"lang":"nl","value":"Moderne en contemporaine geschiedenis"},{"lang":"en","value":"Modern and contemporary history"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"},{"@id":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/D60000","termName":[{"lang":"en","value":"Social sciences"},{"lang":"nl","value":"Sociale wetenschappen"}],"vocabularyUri":"https:\/\/www.narcis.nl\/classification\/"}]},{"typeName":"dansCollection","multiple":true,"typeClass":"primitive","value":["https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/ce21b6fb-4283-4194-9369-b3ff4c3d76e7","https:\/\/vocabularies.dans.knaw.nl\/collections\/ssh\/3d7